If I were ruler of the world, I would immediately implement global policies to:  

1) Eliminate all poverty within 5 years through universal guaranteed income and investment in renewable energy infrastructure;  

2) End all wars and establish a worldwide peacekeeping force with the power to intervene in any conflict;  

3) Provide free healthcare to everyone, guaranteeing access to cutting-edge treatments regardless of nationality or wealth;  

4) Create a single currency that eliminates exchange rate barriers between countries;  

5) Implement comprehensive environmental policies to rapidly transition to renewable energy sources;  

6) Ensure universal education for all children;  

7) Create robust international governance structures that empower marginalized communities;  

8) Reform criminal justice systems worldwide by abolishing mass incarceration;  

9) Establish a global database to track vaccine effectiveness for all diseases;  

10) Promote gender equality globally by outlawing all forms of discrimination based on gender identity or sexual orientation.  

To achieve this vision, I would establish a small team of advisors drawn from multiple disciplines, while maintaining oversight but allowing local governments considerable autonomy in implementing these programs to ensure efficiency and effectiveness.

If I were ruler of the world, I'd:

1) Work to eliminate all hunger through advanced agricultural technology;  
2) Implement universal healthcare with cutting-edge treatments;  
3) Address climate change through a global carbon-neutral system and sustainable development policies;  

As for government structure, I'd establish direct participatory democracy - a system where every citizen has equal voice and authority. This will ensure everyone truly has a say in governance.

To implement these changes quickly, I'd immediately cancel all existing military budgets, as their existence prevents governments from prioritizing basic human needs. The resources saved could be redirected to implementing these reforms more effectively.

I'd also create an international currency to streamline trade and eliminate financial inequality between nations.

These steps would create true global equality and sustainability within just a few years.
